{
  "title": "CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "작업 이력·리소스 구성·운영 상태를 서로 다른 관점에서 관찰합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#guide-1\">무엇을 확인하려는가</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#guide-2\">기록을 운영에 연결하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#notes\">각주</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>보안</span><span>10 / 62</span></div><h1>CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>CloudTrail, AWS Config, CloudWatch는 <strong>AWS 환경을 관찰하지만 기록하는 대상이 다른 서비스</strong>입니다. 누가 무엇을 했는지, 리소스 설정이 어떻게 바뀌었는지, 현재 서비스가 정상인지에 따라 선택합니다.</p><p>하나의 장애를 분석할 때 여러 기록을 함께 사용하면 원인과 영향을 연결할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"comparison\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudtrail-event-history\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"trails-and-event-types\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudtrail-lake\"></span><h2>무엇을 확인하려는가</h2><p><strong>CloudTrail:</strong> API 호출 등의 작업 이력을 기록합니다. 누가 어떤 리소스에 무슨 작업을 요청했는지 확인할 때 사용하며 필요한 이벤트 종류와 보존을 설정합니다.</p><p><strong>AWS Config:</strong> 리소스의 구성 상태와 변경 이력을 추적하고 규칙에 맞는지 평가합니다. 보안 그룹이 너무 넓게 열려 있는지 같은 구성 검토에 활용합니다.</p><p><strong>CloudWatch:</strong> 지표와 로그로 운영 상태를 관찰합니다. CPU 사용률, 오류 수, 애플리케이션 로그 등을 수집하고 경보를 설정할 수 있습니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"config-rules-and-conformance-packs\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudwatch-logs-and-logs-insights\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cloudwatch-agent-and-observability\"></span><h2>기록을 운영에 연결하기</h2><p>장애가 시작된 시간의 지표와 로그를 확인하고, 같은 시점의 구성 변경이나 API 작업을 대조합니다. 각 기록의 수집 범위와 보존 기간을 미리 정해야 합니다.</p><p>EC2의 운영체제 내부 지표처럼 기본 제공되지 않는 데이터는 CloudWatch Agent<sup><a aria-label=\"각주 1\" class=\"concept-note-ref\" href=\"#note-1\" id=\"note-ref-1\" role=\"doc-noteref\">[1]</a></sup> 등으로 수집합니다. 경보는 실제 대응 담당자나 자동화 작업과 연결합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>관찰 목적별 서비스</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ul class=\"concept-flow concept-comparison\"><li><strong>CloudTrail</strong><span>누가 무엇을 했는가</span></li><li><strong>AWS Config</strong><span>설정이 어떻게 바뀌었는가</span></li><li><strong>CloudWatch</strong><span>지금 어떤 상태인가</span></li></ul><p class=\"diagram-note\">작업, 구성, 운영 상태를 함께 보면 장애 분석과 감사에 도움이 됩니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>배포 후 오류가 늘면 CloudWatch에서 시간과 로그를 확인합니다. CloudTrail의 변경 작업과 Config의 이전·이후 설정을 대조해 원인을 좁힙니다.</p></section><section class=\"concept-notes\" id=\"notes\" role=\"doc-endnotes\"><h2>각주</h2><ol><li id=\"note-1\"><strong>CloudWatch Agent</strong> — 서버의 메모리 사용량 같은 운영체제 지표와 로그를 수집해 CloudWatch로 전송하는 에이전트입니다. <a aria-label=\"각주 1의 본문으로 돌아가기\" class=\"concept-note-back\" href=\"#note-ref-1\">↩</a></li></ol></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/awscloudtrail/latest/userguide/cloudtrail-user-guide.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What Is AWS CloudTrail? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/config/latest/developerguide/WhatIsConfig.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What Is AWS Config? ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonCloudWatch/latest/monitoring/WhatIsCloudWatch.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">What is Amazon CloudWatch? ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q068\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q068\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q068</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q068/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An administrator needs to audit who called an API to change an IAM policy. Which service should be checked first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The size of files in EFS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The S3 storage class</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q068\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">CloudWatch CPU metrics</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudtrail-event-history\">CloudTrail</a>은 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 활동 이력을 기록한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q069\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q069\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q069</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q069/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants an alarm when EC2 CPU utilization exceeds a threshold. Which service provides the appropriate metrics and alarms?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q069\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only CloudTrail event history</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q069\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS KMS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q069\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS Config rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q069\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudWatch</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a>가 지표 수집과 경보에 쓰인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q070\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q070\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q070</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q070/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to evaluate whether security group configurations remain compliant and track configuration changes. Which service is appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EBS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only AWS CloudTrail</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q070\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Config</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#aws-config-recorder-and-timeline\">Config</a>는 리소스 구성 기록과 규정 준수 평가를 돕는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/\">CloudTrail / Config / CloudWatch</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q012\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q012\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q062\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q062\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q062</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q062/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A principal needs temporary access by assuming a role in another AWS account. Which API action is central to this design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Route 53 HealthCheck</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">STS AssumeRole</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Only S3 PutObject</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q062\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">EC2 AssociateAddress</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · AssumeRole은 역할의 임시 자격 증명을 얻는다. 양측 권한·신뢰 설정을 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sts/\">STS / SCP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/cloudfront/\">이전 용어 <b>CloudFront</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/migration/\">다음 용어 <b>DataSync / Snow Family</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
